&& Goal refinement and conflicts in passenger transportation.
layout up
Transport @3,0 = /Effective passenger transportation/
Rapid @1,1 = /Rapid\ntransportation/
Safe @5,1 = /Safe\ntransportation/
Fast @1,2 = /Fast journey/
Evacuate @3,2 = /Evacuation\nwhen alarm/
Closed @4,2 = /Doors closed\nbetween stations/
Collision @5,2 = /Avoid train\ncollisions/
Limit @6,2 = /Speed below\nblock limit/
Go @0,3 = /Fast run to next\nblock if go signal/
Signal @2,3 = /Signal promptly\nset to go/
Open @3,3 = /Doors open when\nalarm and stopped/
SharedBlock @5,3 = /Avoid trains\nsharing a block/
Slow @4,4 = /Safety signal\nkept at slow/
Stop @6,4 = /Train stopped at\nblock entry if\nstop signal/

Rapid, Safe __> Transport [o]
Fast __> Rapid
Evacuate, Closed, Collision, Limit __> Safe [o]
Go, Signal __> Fast [o]
Open __> Evacuate
SharedBlock __> Collision
Slow, Stop __> SharedBlock [o]
Open __ Closed [zigzag]
Signal __ Slow [zigzag]
